1
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:09,640
Shen Xi,

2
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,680
I don't care what plans you have
with Song Yanfei,

3
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:14,400
but I know he already has a girlfriend,

4
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,920
and a rich one at that.

5
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,200
Since you also hope

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,160
he can be happy with that girlfriend,

7
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,680
then why can't you just accept me

8
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:21,880
and be with me?

9
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,600
Xiao Ze, wake up, will you?

10
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,960
What happens between me and Song Yanfei
is one thing.

11
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:26,760
Whether I can accept you

12
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:27,920
is another.

13
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:30,360
What's the connection between the two?

14
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,400
If you don't accept me,

15
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,400
then none of us will have a good time.

16
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:47,720
Xiao Ze,

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:49,880
listen to me.

18
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,720
It's not that I won't accept you,

19
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:54,900
nor is it that you're not good enough.

20
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,980
It's just that you don't know,

21
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:58,680
back then Song Yanfei

22
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:01,280
also kept saying

23
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,770
he'd treat me well forever.

24
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:05,860
And the result?

25
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,000
I gave so much for him,

26
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:11,320
but he still ran off

27
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,880
with Gao Yayan for money.

28
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:16,600
But it's fine.

29
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:18,880
People are realistic.

30
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,440
So you don't need to say anymore.

31
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:23,320
I won't believe it.

32
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,520
I'm not like him.

33
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:26,650
I will love you forever.

34
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:27,920
For you,

35
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:30,490
I'm willing to give my everything.

36
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:31,920
Everything?

37
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,320
What is everything?

38
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,720
Absolutely everything,

39
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:37,600
including my life.

40
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:39,120
If you asked me to die,

41
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,120
I wouldn't hesitate.

42
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,400
Words are no proof.

43
00:01:48,039 --> 00:01:48,840
Xiao Ze,

44
00:01:49,759 --> 00:01:51,160
what exactly do you want?

45
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:54,800
I just like you

46
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:56,600
and want to be with you.

47
00:01:58,720 --> 00:01:59,840
Like me?

48
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:04,720
You've been stalking me
from the very beginning.

49
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:07,320
You even set up a telescope
at home to peep at me.

50
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,600
You're a pervert,

51
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,880
a peeping tom.

52
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,720
But I helped you too.

53
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:15,840
Why is this completely different

54
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,600
from what Shen Xi said?

55
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,410
The next part

56
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:22,840
is the key.

57
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,520
Words are no proof.

58
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:26,490
Then tell me,

59
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:27,480
what should I do

60
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,740
to make you believe me?

61
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:32,480
Write it down.

62
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,570
Let me see your determination.

63
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:36,840
Write what?

64
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:40,160
Just write,

65
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,840
"If you don't accept me,

66
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,200
I'll die."

67
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:50,540
You didn't sign it.

68
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:51,800
Write your name.

69
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,000
What about the date?

70
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Should I write it?

71
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,900
That's not necessary.

72
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,640
Who is this for?

73
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,130
Write my name at the beginning.

74
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:08,080
Look,

75
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,320
is this okay?

76
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:14,960
Deceiving yourself.

77
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:17,300
Writing it is useless.

78
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:19,210
How could it be for nothing?

79
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:20,760
Everything I wrote

80
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:22,420
is from the bottom of my heart.

81
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,600
You mean

82
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,000
you're really willing to die for me?

83
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,480
Without hesitation.

84
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,930
There happens to be a rope right there.

85
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:38,160
Why don't you hang yourself and show me?

86
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,740
You don't dare, do you?

87
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:51,680
Men

88
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:53,760
are all the same.

89
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,480
Shen Xi,

90
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,959
I really dare to do it.

91
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:20,839
But are you sure

92
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,600
you want me to die?

93
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:25,560
You're crazy.

94
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:28,450
Why would I want you actually dead?

95
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:29,760
I just wanted to see

96
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,360
if you really mean it.

97
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:35,120
Even if you just hang
there for ten seconds,

98
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,200
I'll believe it.

99
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,090
believe that you truly love me,

100
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,840
and believe you'll treat me well forever.

101
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,880
But

102
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,159
forget it.

103
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:47,200
I won't force you.

104
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:56,440
I dare to.

105
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:57,800
Look.

106
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:05,170
Ten seconds.

107
00:05:05,960 --> 00:05:06,890
Start counting.

108
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:09,680
All right.

109
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,400
Nine.

110
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,120
Eight.

111
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:22,020
Why are you holding on so tightly?

112
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,530
It only takes a few seconds.

113
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,920
As the rope compresses the neck,

114
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,800
the airway gets blocked.

115
00:05:40,159 --> 00:05:41,880
With insufficient oxygen supply,

116
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:44,010
blood flow to the brain drops sharply.

117
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:45,800
He won't be able to control his limbs.

118
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,930
He won't be able to save himself at all.

119
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:50,170
What if he manages to save himself?

120
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:52,760
Then just

121
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,640
comfort him.

122
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,520
Give him a hug.

123
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,380
I'll figure something out later.

124
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,000
He's blinded by love anyway,

125
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:02,060
so he won't actually suspect
you're trying to kill him.

126
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,800
Do we have to do this?

127
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,000
I'm scared.

128
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,000
We have to.

129
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,560
This guy is just too dangerous.

130
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,240
And he knows too much.

131
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:18,000
If it were just about
running over Gao Yuhai,

132
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,130
that'd be one thing.

133
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,120
The case is closed anyway.

134
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,240
Dead men tell no tales.

135
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,120
But today,

136
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,640
he was hiding in the stairwell

137
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,300
and heard everything we said.

138
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,600
But we didn't even say much.

139
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,400
Better safe

140
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,880
than sorry.

141
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:36,200
If he pieces everything together

142
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:37,460
and tells Li Xingchen,

143
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:40,159
Li Xingchen will definitely track us down.

144
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,159
Trust me.

145
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,360
This is foolproof.

146
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,200
Only with Xiao Ze dead

147
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,690
can we truly bury the evidence.

148
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,610
Wait until he stops moving,

149
00:06:57,159 --> 00:06:58,690
and wait for three minutes.

150
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:00,010
Just three minutes.

151
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:02,200
He shouldn't be able to survive that.

152
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:02,920
After that,

153
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,200
lie on the ground,

154
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:06,040
mess up your hair and face,

155
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,560
and run out screaming.

156
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:10,360
Just pretend Xiao Ze
was trying to assault you.

157
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,560
What if someone nearby sees?

158
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:16,320
There's hardly anyone
around there during the day.

159
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:18,120
Even if someone stops to ask you,

160
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,880
you can just ignore them.

161
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:21,920
These are all normal reactions

162
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,200
after a severe shock.

163
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:25,520
Even if they get curious

164
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:26,800
and go into the woods,

165
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,120
or even if they call the police,

166
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:28,880
just stick to the original plan.

167
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:29,720
Just say...

168
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:31,720
He hanged himself while we were talking.

169
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,600
I'm so small.

170
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,730
I couldn't save him.

171
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:35,290
No one will suspect you.

172
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:40,400
Yanfei,

173
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:42,400
I really feel like

174
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:45,600
we've fallen into an endless abyss.

175
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,720
We're sinking deeper and deeper.

176
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:49,180
It's getting terrifying.

177
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:50,880
Sooner or later...

178
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:52,020
That won't happen.

179
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:54,409
It won't.

180
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,340
I'll stay with you.

181
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:03,600
Alright.

182
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,410
You passed the test.

183
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:06,880
Come down.

184
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,200
Xiao Ze, stop chasing me!

185
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:21,660
Xiao Ze,

186
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:22,920
stay away!

187
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,360
Xiao Ze, please let me go!

188
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,800
Why

189
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,960
is this happening?

190
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:24,480
Shen Xi,

191
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:28,160
what on earth did you do?

192
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:56,840
The reconstruction is accurate,

193
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,200
and the evidence is sufficient.

194
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,960
Especially the recording found at the end,

195
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:02,680
which nailed down the fact that

196
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:04,720
Shen Xi instigated Xiao Ze's suicide.

197
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:06,960
But Shen Xi has already committed suicide
out of fear of punishment.

198
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,200
We can't hold her

199
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:09,860
criminally responsible now.

200
00:12:10,400 --> 00:12:12,000
You suspect Song Yanfei now,

201
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,620
but where is the evidence?

202
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:19,200
Yes, I admit, Chief Wu,

203
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,440
that the evidence is insufficient
right now.

204
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:22,440
Judging from this recording alone,

205
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:23,720
it only proves that

206
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:24,920
Song Yanfei might have mentioned

207
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:27,200
some plan to Shen Xi before.

208
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:29,620
But as for what this plan actually is,

209
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:31,280
he could just make one up,

210
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:32,120
right?

211
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:34,340
For example, it's also plausible

212
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,320
that they were after
the Gao family's property

213
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,450
and tried to deceive

214
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:37,400
Gao Yayan.

215
00:12:37,920 --> 00:12:38,760
Right, and

216
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,160
listening to the whole recording,

217
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:41,120
Song Yanfei can easily

218
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,650
clear his name completely.

219
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:45,720
He can say Shen Xi ordered him
to throw the hemp rope.

220
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:48,080
He can claim he had no idea
what Shen Xi was going to do.

221
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,360
Shen Xi also took the blame

222
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,960
for hitting and killing Gao Yuhai

223
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,290
in her dying recording.

224
00:12:52,400 --> 00:12:53,120
The further we go,

225
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,320
the clearer we know that

226
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:56,850
all of this is closely related
to Song Yanfei.

227
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,060
We can even say that

228
00:12:58,120 --> 00:13:00,280
it might have been orchestrated
by Song Yanfei.

229
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:02,480
So it's not impossible to arrest him
and interrogate him hard.

230
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:04,320
But if there's no result

231
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,160
by the deadline,

232
00:13:05,160 --> 00:13:06,360
we'll be too passive.

233
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,240
Hard interrogation is definitely
out of the question.

234
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:10,040
We need to take a long-term view.

235
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:11,040
By the way, Xingchen.

236
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:12,240
If you say Song Yanfei

237
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:13,400
orchestrated it,

238
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:14,360
then what is

239
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,560
his motive?

240
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:17,170
Have you figured it out?

241
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,320
There are a few motives.

242
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:20,480
First, Shen Xi might have been

243
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:22,080
humiliated by Feng Shu and Gao Yuhai

244
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:24,920
before the competition.

245
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,120
And the two

246
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:27,480
didn't keep their promise

247
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,480
to give her the championship

248
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:29,520
and let her get the prize money.

249
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:30,440
Song Yanfei and Shen Xi

250
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:32,360
held a grudge.

251
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:33,080
That's the first one.

252
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:33,880
The third one.

253
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,320
Song Yanfei likes Gao Yayan

254
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,650
and wants to be with her.

255
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:38,760
But he was strongly rejected

256
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:41,520
by Gao Yuhai,

257
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:42,920
who used cutting off

258
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:45,200
Gao Yayan's living expenses

259
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:47,240
to force her to get engaged to Feng Shu.

260
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:49,570
The engagement ceremony is approaching.

261
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:51,400
At this time,

262
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:52,720
if Gao Yuhai dies,

263
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:55,080
it might be the most powerful excuse

264
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,400
to stop this engagement ceremony.

265
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:57,800
There's also a third one.

266
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:00,360
Gao Yayan is Gao Yuhai's only daughter.

267
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,480
Gao Yuhai is dead.

268
00:14:01,680 --> 00:14:02,480
Gao Yayan will inherit

269
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:04,160
his entire estate.

270
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:05,000
If Song Yanfei

271
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:07,720
marries Gao Yayan now,

272
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,720
at least half of it

273
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:11,080
will be his.

274
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:13,600
Right now, the only other person

275
00:14:14,400 --> 00:14:15,720
who could stop this wedding

276
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,560
is Shen Xi.

277
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:19,080
All of this only works if Shen Xi is dead.

278
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:21,520
So, driving Shen Xi into a corner

279
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:22,640
until she breaks down

280
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:23,770
and commits suicide

281
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:26,220
is what Song Yanfei has wanted all along.

282
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:27,560
And

283
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,440
one last thing.

284
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:32,000
Go ahead, Captain Li.

285
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,680
Director Wu, do you remember

286
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:48,970
the case eight years ago

287
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:50,760
when the chairman of Dacheng Group

288
00:14:50,760 --> 00:14:52,360
in our city

289
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,120
committed suicide to escape punishment?

290
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,120
Of course I do.

291
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:56,520
You were the one responsible
for monitoring

292
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:58,050
Song Yucheng's residence.

293
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,320
You even wanted to resign

294
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:00,280
over this.

295
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,120
If I hadn't stopped you,

296
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,980
you'd be out of the uniform by now.

297
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:06,040
Song Yucheng

298
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:08,560
is Song Yanfei's father.

299
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:17,010
Gao Yayan...

